    "name": "Green Gage Plums",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Green Gage plums are premium, honey-sweet European dessert fruits featuring a distinctive yellow-green skin and translucent, rich flesh.</span></p><ul class=\"lexical-text-editor--list-ul\"><li value=\"1\"><b><strong class=\"lexical-text-editor--bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Flavor Profile:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Exceptionally sweet and aromatic with complex notes of ripe mango, dried apricot, and honey.</span></li><li value=\"2\"><b><strong class=\"lexical-text-editor--bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Texture:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Succulent, dense, and juicy flesh with an easily removable freestone pit.</span></li></ul>",
